# W44-211 — tuning extract verification meta

Source state: working copy on top of `main = badacc0f` (post-W44-210).
Branch / workspace: `w44-211-tuning-extract` sibling.

## Scope

Move all VarDCT numeric tunable consts under a single canonical access
path `jxl_encoder::tuning::<module>::*` + add opt-in
`tuning-override` cargo feature for the future sweep runner.

Production binary MUST be BYTE-IDENTICAL.

## What shipped

### New module: `jxl-encoder/src/tuning.rs` (731 lines)

14 submodules + 1 opt-in `runtime` submodule:

- `discriminator_thresholds` — 36 entries (mask/m3/edge_density/fcbr/distance windows)
- `entropy_mul_tables` — re-exports `EntropyMulTable`
- `buttloop` — 25 entries (qf seed, EPF seed, adaptive_quant qf pre-scale, etc.)
- `coeff_orders` — 3 entries (per-bucket gates stay in gate_registry.rs)
- `epf` — 9 entries
- `patches` — 17 entries
- `splines` — 12 entries
- `gaborish` — 3 entries
- `noise` — 9 entries
- `cfl` — 12 entries (4 Newton consts exposed at simd crate root)
- `quant_weights` — 17 libjxl-spec band-param tables (READ-ONLY)
- `ac_strategy` — 6 cost-model exponents (READ-ONLY)
- `dc_tree` — 2 effort gates
- `gates` — 6 top-level effort/pixel/distance gates
- `squeeze` — 4 modular alpha extra-channel quantizer consts
- `runtime` (opt-in `tuning-override`) — `RuntimeTuning` + `install` + `install_from_postcard_file`

### 2 new `pub const` aliases (NEW, NOT replacing existing sites)

- `SMART_ZENJXL_PHOTO_MASK_P25_MIN: f32 = 85.0`
- `SCREENSHOT_MEDIAN_THRESHOLD: f32 = 95.0`

Both protected by compile-time `const _: () = assert!(...)` that every
constituent site agrees with the alias. If any site drifts the
constant won't compile.

