- `vardct/patches.rs`: 17 (detection + cost-benefit)
- `vardct/quant.rs`: 14 (parametric quant-weight tables — spec)
- `vardct/ac_strategy.rs`: 6 (cost-model exponents — spec)
- `vardct/gaborish.rs`: 3
